# The vast unknown — the planet is disposable and lives on disk only.
# RUN_002/BITER_ATTACK!! scuttled the engine with `git rm --cached`, so every
# file is still on disk and still untracked. This keeps a stray `git add -A`
# from silently re-tracking a world that was deliberately ended.
# A new engine enters the repo on purpose or not at all: `git add -f`.
_THE VAST UNKNOWN/
